chigan/huron-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids April to May and August to September each came in under 90% of normal in 33 of the 75 years. In 2025, on the middle of the grids, January to February came in at 64% of normal and August to September at 77%. Every grid had its driest year in 1958, with grid 28389 and grid 28390 at 68% that year.</p>"}
